WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:06.230
All is quiet at the facility where SCP-1027
floats in its containment chamber.

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:10.809
The SCP does not seem to react as a guard
opens the door to its room.

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:16.139
The agent gropes for the light switch; he
is new to SCP Foundation, and this is his

00:00:16.139 --> 00:00:18.380
first night working on his own.

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.779
Harsh fluorescent light fills the room.

00:00:20.779 --> 00:00:25.560
The guard lets out a yelp when he sees SCP-1027
for the first time.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:30.019
Unable to control his curiosity, the guard
approaches the containment chamber.

00:00:30.019 --> 00:00:36.210
SCP-1027 looks like a human nervous system
that has been extracted from its body.

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:41.470
The brain, eyes, and connective nerves are
all exposed as if some mad doctor perfectly

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:43.530
dissected a human.

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:46.270
SCP-1027 does not move.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:50.560
Gross, the guard thinks as he taps on the
glass casing with his rifle.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.290
He jumps back slightly in surprise.

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:56.910
It seemed as if the eyeballs had twitched
slightly to look at him.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:59.469
“So creepy,” the guard says out loud.

00:00:59.469 --> 00:01:01.579
He turns around to exit the room.

00:01:01.579 --> 00:01:04.110
As he approaches the door, the lights flicker.

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:06.409
He begins to walk a little quicker.

00:01:06.409 --> 00:01:10.700
Suddenly the lights go out completely, plunging
the room into darkness.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:16.010
A moment later, the hum of the fluorescents
resumes as the lights come back to life.

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:19.869
The guard slowly pivots to look at the containment
chamber.

00:01:19.869 --> 00:01:24.130
SCP-1027 still floats motionless in its saline
solution.

00:01:24.130 --> 00:01:27.590
The guard sighs and chuckles to himself for
getting spooked.

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:31.570
He turns and walks out of the room, closing
the door behind him.

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:34.630
He makes it a few steps down the hallway before
stopping.

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:37.340
The guard smacks his forehead with the palm
of his hand.

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:40.020
“I forgot to turn off the damn light,”
he says.

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:43.979
He heads back to the room SCP-1027 is contained
in.

00:01:43.979 --> 00:01:46.700
He reaches his hand out to grab the doorknob.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.500
It is warm to the touch.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.310
The guard turns it and pushes the door open.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:57.280
A scream gets caught in his throat and only
a slight wheeze escapes his lungs.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:01.140
Standing in front of him is SCP-1027.

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:05.490
The nervous system seems to pulsate as it
reaches its arms out towards the guard who

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.310
is paralyzed with fear.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:12.690
The guard feels a slight twinge in his ear
as a series of nerves enter his auditory canal.

00:02:12.690 --> 00:02:15.230
Then he hears a voice inside of his head.

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:19.770
It’s his own voice, and it’s telling him
to escape his body.

00:02:19.770 --> 00:02:24.860
The next morning SCP agents and scientists
return to the site for another day’s work.

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:29.550
One scientist is surprised to find the door
to SCP-1027’s room wide open.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.850
He steps in and looks around.

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:36.440
SCP-1027 floats motionless inside of its saline
containment chamber.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:40.390
The scientist shrugs, turns off the light,
and closes the door.

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:45.470
Later that day a feeding team enters SCP-1027’s
room pushing a cart with the brain of a cow

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:46.730
on top of it.

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:50.730
The three members of the group are wearing
level-4 bio-protective equipment.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:53.570
They enter the room and secure the door behind
them.

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:57.890
One of the men walks over to the containment
chamber and pushes a few buttons.

00:02:57.890 --> 00:03:04.200
As the liquid in the tube slowly begins to
drain, SCP-1027 drops down into a laying position

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.340
on the examination table below it.

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:10.730
When the water is completely gone, the glass
tube hisses open.

00:03:10.730 --> 00:03:14.200
A moment later SCP-1027 sits up.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.250
It looks about the room with its exposed eyeballs.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:21.820
Its nerves wriggle like tiny worms as they
sense the world around them.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:26.880
SCP-1027 rotates its body so it’s sitting
with its legs over the side of the table.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:31.490
The feeding team tries to remain calm, but
seeing a nervous system move without an actual

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:35.170
body is a bit disconcerting to say the least.

00:03:35.170 --> 00:03:40.330
Researchers found that SCP-1027 was able to
survive without the protective casing of muscles

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:46.370
and skin because each nerve cell is surrounded
by myelin sheathing 300 times thicker than

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.020
that of normal human cells.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:54.200
The SCP slowly slides off the table and proceeds
towards the cow brain that has been placed

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.900
in the middle of the room.

00:03:55.900 --> 00:04:00.830
The feeding team backs as far away from the
SCP as possible until their bodies are pressed

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:02.510
up against the wall.

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:07.850
SCP researchers told them that the containment
suits would protect them from 1027, but these

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:10.650
same researchers have been wrong before.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:15.440
SCP-1027 stands next to the cow brain and
looks down at it.

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:20.400
Normally at this point, SCP-1027 would extend
its nerves and wrap them around the bovine

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.400
brain.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:25.010
There would be a slight pulsing and the brain
would begin to denature.

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:30.980
It is still unclear if SCP-1027 consumes the
actual brain matter or just feeds on the residual

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.750
chemical energy that resides in the tissue.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:38.650
The feeding team carries out this procedure
once a week, which seems to keep SCP-1027

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:39.900
happy.

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:45.530
But this time, SCP-1027 just stares at the
brain as if it is contemplating whether it

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:46.850
is worth eating.

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:51.340
It is almost as if SCP-1027 isn’t hungry.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:53.140
As if it has already eaten.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:58.670
But the team knows that’s crazy as they
are the only ones who feed this SCP, and it

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:02.060
has been exactly a week since its previous
meal.

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:06.330
The feeding team turns their heads to look
at one another through the clear face shields

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.680
in their suits.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:13.410
One of the men shrugs as they all turn back
to watch what SCP-1027 does next.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:17.650
The SCP lifts its head so that its eyes are
looking straight at the feeding team.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:21.020
One of the members reaches behind him searching
for the doorknob.

00:05:21.020 --> 00:05:25.860
Then, SCP-1027 slowly turns around and walks
back towards the table.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.520
It lays down and goes still.

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:32.480
“Someone needs to lock it back in its containment
chamber,” one of the men says.

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:36.990
“That’s Jerry’s job,” responds another
as he pushes the man next to him towards where

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:38.180
SCP-1027 is laying.

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:40.180
“Alright, fine, I’ll do it.

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:44.840
But if that thing eats me and turns me into
an SCP, you two will be the first people I

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:45.840
go after.”

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:48.680
Jerry walks slowly towards the containment
chamber.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:52.820
He stretches his arm as far as it will go
to keep as much distance as possible between

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:55.690
his body and SCP-1027.

00:05:55.690 --> 00:06:00.020
Jerry pushes a big red button and the glass
tube hisses close.

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:06.190
The containment chamber fills with saline
water and SCP-1027 is once again suspended

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:08.150
in the liquid-filled tube.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:12.520
The research team grabs the cart with the
cow brain on it and rushes out of the room,

00:06:12.520 --> 00:06:14.540
slamming the door behind them.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:19.070
They inform the head of the facility of the
odd behavior SCP-1027 had exhibited.

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:22.900
But he is a busy man and shrugs it off as
just an anomaly.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.840
“It’ll eat when it’s hungry enough.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:28.860
Give it a week and then try again,” the
facility commander tells the men.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:33.150
The feeding team walks silently down the hall
to the decontamination room where they will

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:38.100
take off their suits and shower as a precaution
to prevent the spread of any foreign agents.

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:42.810
The peculiar behavior of SCP-1027 lingers
in their minds.

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:46.550
They enter the room and begin to joke with
one another to ease their nerves.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.030
This makes them feel better.

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:53.190
It is silly to worry about SCP-1027 now that
it is safely contained in its chamber once

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:54.190
again.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:57.190
They turn the shower heads on and steam slowly
fills the room.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:07:00.030
“I might call out sick next week, just to
be safe.

00:07:00.030 --> 00:07:04.200
That SCP is going to be really hungry after
missing its meal this week and I don’t want

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:06.990
to become a snack,” one of the men says
as he scrubs his body.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.910
“Yeah, that’s not a bad idea,” responds
Jerry.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:14.540
“Who knows what that creepy thing will do
if it ever gets out of its containment chamber.

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:16.100
Maybe it’ll eat our brains.

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:21.180
Although there wouldn’t be much to eat in
your case Bob,” he says pointing to his

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:22.180
teammate.

00:07:22.180 --> 00:07:25.180
The whole team laughs as the room continues
to fill with steam.

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:29.180
Jerry’s smile slowly fades as he feels something
tickle his ear.

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:32.190
He uses his hand to brush whatever it was
away.

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:34.000
But the sensation comes back.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:38.160
Jerry washes the soap from his face and turns
around; all he can see is steam.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:41.210
“Hey you guys, stop messing around,” Jerry
yells.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.010
“What are you talking about Jerry?”

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:44.860
one of the other members of the team asks.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.760
Jerry sees the steam move directly in front
of him.

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:50.919
He rubs his eyes to help him focus through
the moisture.

00:07:50.919 --> 00:07:56.240
When he takes his hands away an instance of
SCP-1027 is standing directly in front of

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:57.240
him.

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:01.120
He is staring straight into the eyeballs of
the nervous system of the guard who had entered

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:04.060
SCP-1027’s room the previous night.

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:09.540
“What the—” but before Jerry can finish
his sentence the instance of SCP-1027 shoves

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:13.480
its nerves down Jerry’s throat silencing
his voice.

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:17.060
It then sticks the nerves of its hand into
Jerry’s ear.

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:22.440
The SCP-1027 instance feels around in Jerry’s
head until it locates the part of the brain

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:25.160
it is looking for and connects to it.

00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:29.060
Jerry’s brain is flooded with dopamine and
chemical signals are transferred from the

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:33.620
SCP-1027 instance directly into its victim’s
brain.

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:38.620
Jerry’s nervous system now wants to break
free of the flesh casing that contains it.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:42.080
“Jerry, are you okay over there?” asks
Bob.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.380
“You’ve gone kinda quiet.”

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:46.110
But there is no response.

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:50.790
Jerry’s nervous system moves his body towards
one of the shower knobs and turns the hot

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.330
water on full blast.

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:57.160
It’s hoping that if the water is hot enough
it will scald the skin and muscle tissue making

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:59.930
it easier to remove from the body.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:00.930
“Jerry?”

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.310
the other team member says.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:06.820
Suddenly the steam shifts and the SCP-1027
instance is standing in the middle of the

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:07.930
shower room.

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:10.910
The remaining members of the feeding team
scream in horror.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:14.420
They try to escape but slip on the wet shower
floor.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:18.490
SCP-1027 slowly approaches them with its nerves
outstretched.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:22.250
The echoing shouts from the feeding team are
muffled as a series of nerves enter their

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:23.250
bodies.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:27.760
The day continues at the SCP site as if everything
was normal.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:32.880
Agents are debriefed on previous missions,
scientists experiment on different SCPs, and

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:35.920
administrators meet to plan the next acquisition.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:39.570
The sun begins to set and people start to
leave for the day.

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:43.800
All is quiet that night as a new security
guard makes his rounds.

00:09:43.800 --> 00:09:47.850
The guard that the administrator of the facility
had just hired disappeared without a trace

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.360
the night before.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:53.580
His disappearance was chalked up to nerves
and being too scared to return to work.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:57.140
The new guard checks each room to make sure
everything is secure.

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:01.000
He approaches the room that contains SCP-1027.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:05.690
He opens the door, flicks on the light, and
looks at the SCP floating in its containment

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:06.690
tube.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:08.529
“Gross,” the guard says out loud.

00:10:08.529 --> 00:10:11.460
He flicks off the light and continues his
rounds.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:16.720
Near the far part of the hallway the door
to the decontamination room is slightly ajar.

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:19.760
The guard approaches and pushes it open with
his nightstick.

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:24.470
He takes one step into the darkness and feels
the wall for the light switch.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:25.850
He turns the lights on.

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.380
There is nothing there but a wet floor.

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:31.000
The guard shrugs and turns off the lights.

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.810
He walks through the doorway.

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:39.020
As he steps back into the hallway, he is greeted
by four instances of SCP-1027.

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:43.500
The guard opens his mouth to scream as the
nervous systems reach out their tendrils and

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:47.140
plunge them into his ears, nose, and mouth.

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:51.730
Now watch “SCP-1548 - The Star, the Hateful
(SCP Animation).”

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:56.490
Or check out “SCP-001 - The Children - Ouroboros
Cycle (SCP Animation).”

